      <h1>Baijiu Aroma Types</h1>
      <p class="lede">China recognises twelve aroma types. Six of them cover almost every bottle you will meet abroad. This is the map — with the standard code, the flavour signature, and the benchmark bottle for each.</p>
      <div class="article-meta">
